<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">Our Depositary Shares are
listed on the NASDAQ Capital Market under the symbol &#8220;BDRX.&#8221; The Depositary Shares trade exclusively on NASDAQ. There is currently
no market for our Ordinary Shares.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

