<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt 0">All revenue came from the sale of services in 2023.
It is derived entirely from the Group&#8217;s R&amp;D collaboration agreements. It is recognised over the contract term proportionate
to the progress in overall satisfaction of the performance obligations.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt 0"></p>

