</ix:nonNumeric><p id="xdx_8A7_zIzGWGEhghh5" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt 0">The Group&#8217;s R&amp;D collaboration agreements
are the delivery of services within the next 12 months for which the practical expedient in paragraph 121 (a) of IFRS15 applies.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt 0">In 2025, no revenue from customers (2024: no revenue;
2023: 1 customer).</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt 0"></p>

