<p style="font: bold 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt 0">Key management personnel compensation</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt 0"><span id="xdx_90F_ecustom--DisclosureOfInformationAboutKeyManagementPersonnel_c20250101__20251231_zfSCoccJKoae" title="Disclosure of information about key management personnel"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2025-01-01to2025-12-31" id="Fact001177" name="bdrx:DisclosureOfInformationAboutKeyManagementPersonnel">Key management personnel are those persons having
authority and responsibility for planning, directing and controlling the activities of the Group, including the Directors of the Company,
including the Chief Executive Officer and Chief Scientific Officer</ix:nonNumeric></span> for 2024 and 2023.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt 0"></p>

