<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt 0">During the year no Directors (2024:0; 2023: 0) participated
in a defined contribution pension scheme. Pension contributions in the above note include those of the Chief Scientific Officer for 2024
and 2023.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt 7.1pt 0pt 0">Emoluments disclosed above include the following
amounts in respect of the highest paid Director.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt 7.1pt 0pt 0"></p>

