<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">As at 31 December the right of use
asset consisted of leasehold improvements of net book value &#163;<span id="xdx_909_eifrs-full--RightofuseAssets_c20251231__ifrs-full--ClassesOfPropertyPlantAndEquipmentAxis__ifrs-full--LeaseholdImprovementsMember_pn3p" title="Right of use asset"><ix:nonFraction name="ifrs-full:RightofuseAssets" contextRef="AsOf2025-12-31_ifrs-full_LeaseholdImprovementsMember" id="Fact001671" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" unitRef="GBP">79,000</ix:nonFraction></span> (2024: &#163;<span id="xdx_90A_eifrs-full--RightofuseAssets_c20241231__ifrs-full--ClassesOfPropertyPlantAndEquipmentAxis__ifrs-full--LeaseholdImprovementsMember_pn3p" title="Right of use asset"><ix:nonFraction name="ifrs-full:RightofuseAssets" contextRef="AsOf2024-12-31_ifrs-full_LeaseholdImprovementsMember" id="Fact001673" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" unitRef="GBP">215,000</ix:nonFraction></span>; 2023: &#163;<span id="xdx_90B_eifrs-full--RightofuseAssets_c20231231__ifrs-full--ClassesOfPropertyPlantAndEquipmentAxis__ifrs-full--LeaseholdImprovementsMember_pn3p" title="Right of use asset"><ix:nonFraction name="ifrs-full:RightofuseAssets" contextRef="AsOf2023-12-31_ifrs-full_LeaseholdImprovementsMember" id="Fact001675" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" unitRef="GBP">350,000</ix:nonFraction></span>).</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">On 1 February 2023 laboratory equipment
previously disclosed within right of use assets was transferred to laboratory equipment when the final payment on the finance lease was
made.<br/>
&#160;</p>

