<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">During 2025, 2024 and 2023, cash inflows arose from equity financing
transactions, included within financing activities on the face of the cash flow statement. As part of the equity transactions entered
in December 2025, July and May 2024 and December and May 2023 warrants to the value of &#163;5.0 million ( 2024: &#163;3.1 million;
2023: &#163;4.6 million) were issued as disclosed in note 19.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

