<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">Book values approximate to fair value at 31 December 2025, 2024 and
2023.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">All current trade and other payables are payable within 3 months of
the period end date shown above.</p>

