  </table></ix:nonNumeric>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">The potential deferred tax asset of &#163;<span id="xdx_90A_eifrs-full--NetDeferredTaxAssets_iI_pn3n3_dm_c20251231_zYaQo7s1Jh6f" title="Net deferred tax assets"><ix:nonFraction name="ifrs-full:NetDeferredTaxAssets" contextRef="AsOf2025-12-31" id="Fact003206" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="6" unitRef="GBP">20.5</ix:nonFraction></span> million (2024: &#163;<span id="xdx_90F_eifrs-full--NetDeferredTaxAssets_iI_pn3n3_dm_c20241231_z4GLfeY14eWj" title="Net deferred tax assets"><ix:nonFraction name="ifrs-full:NetDeferredTaxAssets" contextRef="AsOf2024-12-31" id="Fact003208" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="6" unitRef="GBP">19.9</ix:nonFraction></span>
million, 2023: &#163;<span id="xdx_90E_eifrs-full--NetDeferredTaxAssets_iI_pn3n3_dm_c20231231_zWSfLmaq74e6" title="Net deferred tax assets"><ix:nonFraction name="ifrs-full:NetDeferredTaxAssets" contextRef="AsOf2023-12-31" id="Fact003210" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="6" unitRef="GBP">18.9</ix:nonFraction> </span>million) has not been provided in these accounts due to uncertainty as to whether the asset would be recovered.
The losses have arisen as a result of accumulated trading losses.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><span id="xdx_901_ecustom--DescriptionOfDeferredTaxAsset_c20250101__20251231_zGYAIdbdKMZa" title="Description of deferred tax asset"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2025-01-01to2025-12-31" id="Fact003212" name="bdrx:DescriptionOfDeferredTaxAsset">Deferred tax asset balances disclosed as at 31 December 2025 have been
calculated at 25%. The main rate of corporation tax increased to 25% from 1 April 2023.</ix:nonNumeric></span></p>

<ix:exclude><p id="xdx_237_z0kCkzY2QA5k" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p></ix:exclude>

