<p style="font: bold 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">During the year the Company issued the following warrants over ADSs,
and these were recognised in the warrant reserve until exercise:</p>

