<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: bold 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><tr style="vertical-align: top">
<td style="width: 0"/><td style="width: 27pt">24</td><td><span id="xdx_826_z5CZvsg8Cqp1">Retirement
benefits</span></td></tr></table>

<p style="font: bold 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 27pt; color: #00A3DB; text-indent: -27pt">&#160;</p>


<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">The Group operates a defined contribution pension scheme for the benefit
of its employees. The assets of the scheme are administered by trustees in funds independent from those of the Group. The annual charge
for the year was &#163;<span id="xdx_90D_ecustom--RetirementBenefits_pn3n3_c20250101__20251231_zIjE26h0AOO9" title="Retirement benefits"><ix:nonFraction name="bdrx:RetirementBenefits" contextRef="From2025-01-01to2025-12-31" id="Fact003498" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="GBP">69,000</ix:nonFraction></span> (2024: &#163;<span id="xdx_90D_ecustom--RetirementBenefits_pn3n3_c20240101__20241231_zERKbUEXNmy9" title="Retirement benefits"><ix:nonFraction name="bdrx:RetirementBenefits" contextRef="From2024-01-012024-12-31" id="Fact003500" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="GBP">67,000</ix:nonFraction></span>)</p>

<ix:exclude><p id="xdx_235_zzzyiEB75Bjb" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p></ix:exclude>

<ix:exclude><!-- Field: Page; Sequence: 178 -->
    <div style="border-bottom: Black 2px solid; margin-top: 8pt; margin-bottom: 6pt"><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; font-size: 10pt"><tr style="vertical-align: top; text-align: left"><td style="width: 33%">&#160;</td><td style="width: 34%; text-align: center">F-<!-- Field: Sequence; Type: Arabic; Name: PageNo -->55<!-- Field: /Sequence --></td><td style="width: 33%; text-align: right">&#160;</td></tr></table></div>
