<ix:exclude><p id="xdx_231_zw0fNAs3yKal" style="font: bold 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 27pt; color: #00A3DB; text-indent: -27pt">&#160;</p></ix:exclude>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">The following information is relevant in the determination of the fair
value of options granted during the year 2024 under the equity share based remuneration schemes operated by the Group.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"></p>

