<table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse">
  <tr style="vertical-align: top">
    <td style="width: 3%">*</td>
    <td style="width: 97%">The share price used in the determination of the fair value of the ADS warrants granted in 2025 was the ADS price on the date of grant.</td></tr>
  <tr style="vertical-align: top">
    <td style="text-align: justify">&#160;</td>
    <td style="text-align: justify">&#160;</td></tr>
  <tr style="vertical-align: top">
    <td>**</td>
    <td>Volatility was calculated with reference to the historic share price volatility of comparable companies measured over a three-year period.</td></tr>
  </table>
<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; color: #4D4D4C"><span style="color: windowtext"></span></p>

