<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">The following information is relevant in the determination of the fair
value of warrants granted during the year 2024.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

