</ix:nonNumeric><p id="xdx_8AE_ztEXbSE9m098" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">Number and original price of warrants have been adjusted
to reflect the ratio change of ADS&#8217;s to ordinary shares that occurred on 5 July 2023, 4 October 2024 and 31 July 2025.<br/>
</p>

